 "text": "50 general-seat members for PP-51–PP-100 as of 2026-11-15. Six members entered through by-elections: PP-52, PP-54, PP-73, PP-87, PP-93 and PP-98. The assembly’s directory still displays former occupants for some seats; subsequent election notifications and oath reports determine those entries."
